# Top 3 Boots's by KernelName

Boots is the total number of host boots over the entire lifespan.

```
+-----+------------+-------+
| Pos | KernelName | Boots |
+-----+------------+-------+
|  1. |    FreeBSD |   872 |
|  2. |     *Linux |   867 |
|  3. |   *OpenBSD |    44 |
+-----+------------+-------+
```
